WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.920
These are the 14 strongest characters in One
Piece whose true powers are still unexplained.

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.330
Starting with Monkey D. Dragon.

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:11.360
This mysterious man is the absent father of
Luffy and the leader of the Revolutionary

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:12.360
Army.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:16.369
His stated goal is to take down the corrupt
nobles who rule the World Government.

00:00:16.369 --> 00:00:20.619
And while we’ve never seen him fight, whenever
he shows up strange things always happen.

00:00:20.619 --> 00:00:25.289
For instance, when he appeared in Logue Town
in chapter 100 Luffy was saved by a freak

00:00:25.289 --> 00:00:28.160
lightning storm that arrived out of nowhere.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:33.670
Or in the Goa kingdom, strong winds saved
citizens from a raging fire when Dragon arrived

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:34.890
at the island.

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:39.371
And these examples have led many to speculate
that Dragon has a devil fruit or an ancient

00:00:39.371 --> 00:00:41.579
weapon that can control the weather.

00:00:41.579 --> 00:00:45.649
What a power to have in this world covered
with water.

00:00:45.649 --> 00:00:50.100
We also know that Luffy likely gets his unbreakable
will and haki from Dragon.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:54.579
And on top of that, he is also the most wanted
man in the world, and judging by the rest

00:00:54.579 --> 00:00:59.750
of his family, Dragon should be one of the
most powerful characters in the story.

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:04.390
However, there is also some evidence that
Dragon may not be as strong as many people

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:05.390
think he is.

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:09.310
For example, Blackbeard was able to destroy
the Revolutionary army’s base.

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:14.360
And while Dragon and the revolutionaries easily
survived, it makes me wonder how strong Dragon

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:15.360
actually is.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:20.500
But while we can possibly question Dragon’s
strength, one undeniable powerhouse in Luffy’s

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:23.390
family is his grandpa Monkey D. Garp.

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:28.790
The Hero of the Marines, Garp is a famous
retired Vice-admiral who was the rival and

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:31.690
friend of former pirate king Gol D. Roger.

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:37.200
He is respected by LITERALLY every single
marine and was even offered the position of

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:40.720
admiral many times, though he always turned
it down.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:45.770
He is even capable of defeating Yonko level
characters, like we see in the special chapter

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:46.950
Strong World.

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:52.869
In this chapter, he and former fleet admiral
Sengoku take down Shiki, who was Roger’s

00:01:52.869 --> 00:01:55.570
main pirate rival.

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:58.420
But what have we actually seen from Garp?

00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:04.310
While we’ve never really seen him fight,
we do know he has ridiculous physical strength.

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:09.369
He throws cannonballs like bullets, brawls
with his fists, and has top-tier haki.

00:02:09.369 --> 00:02:13.810
And while he did not participate during the
war at marineford, Garp certainly felt capable

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:19.250
of killing Akainu after the blood thirsty
admiral punched a hole through Ace.

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:21.880
But is he one of the strongest characters
alive?

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:27.840
In the past, we know he rivaled Whitebeard
and even teamed up with Roger to take down

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:32.240
Rocks D. Xebec, probably the most powerful
pirate in history.

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:37.900
But if he is on their level, do we really
believe he is just throwing fists with all

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:39.570
these top tier fighters.

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:44.349
I mean every other elite fighter in the series
uses some kind of weapon or ability.

00:02:44.349 --> 00:02:45.349
A sword.

00:02:45.349 --> 00:02:46.349
A gun.

00:02:46.349 --> 00:02:47.349
A devil fruit.

00:02:47.349 --> 00:02:49.510
But we haven’t seen Garp use any of these.

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:54.050
Surely he won’t just chuck cannonballs when
he tries to rescue Koby from Blackbeard.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:59.409
So is he actually hiding a secret ability
or is he just the greatest Haki master in

00:02:59.409 --> 00:03:00.569
all of One Piece?

00:03:00.569 --> 00:03:04.980
And what if I told you that Garp was probably
not even the strongest marine?

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:09.159
One character whose powers are a complete
mystery is the World Government Commander

00:03:09.159 --> 00:03:10.840
in Chief, Kong.

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:14.840
But just look at this absolute chad of a man.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:17.819
Who would want to step up to this dude in
a fight?

00:03:17.819 --> 00:03:21.849
Even though we don’t know his individual
fighting strength, we know that he controls

00:03:21.849 --> 00:03:24.099
the marines and Cipher Pol.

00:03:24.099 --> 00:03:29.290
And since marines are usually promoted based
on fighting ability, Kong must have incredible

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:34.019
powers since he was the fleet admiral before
Sengoku and Akainu.

00:03:34.019 --> 00:03:38.010
And there is a likely explanation for why
Oda is keeping his abilities a mystery.

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:42.959
You see, he could very easily be one of the
final opponents the straw hats face on their

00:03:42.959 --> 00:03:47.220
journey, and we will learn more about his
powers in the final battles ahead.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:51.430
And speaking of straw hats, there have always
been many questions about Zoro and Sanji’s

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:52.500
true abilities.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:56.849
Like, does Zoro’s unrelenting drive to be
the strongest swordsman in the world mean

00:03:56.849 --> 00:03:58.970
he will unlock conqueror’s Haki?

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:02.439
And how exactly can Sanji light his legs on
fire?

00:04:02.439 --> 00:04:06.930
Well during the Wano arc, we finally got these
answers.

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:11.760
After Zoro cuts Kaido deep enough to leave
a scar, the Yonko himself tells us that Zoro

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:14.120
just attacked using Conqueror’s haki.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:16.009
No other confirmation needed.

00:04:16.009 --> 00:04:20.570
And as for Sanji, it turns out that he has
genetically modified genes.

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:25.419
These genes are from an almost extinct race
of sky people that have the ability to create

00:04:25.419 --> 00:04:26.530
fire at will.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:31.210
Now that we finally know how these unique
abilities work, it hopefully won’t be long

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:36.240
until Zoro and Sanji reach the level of the
rest of the characters on this list.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:40.949
Another character we just learned a whole
lot more about is Shanks.

00:04:40.949 --> 00:04:45.560
What we’ve long know is that as a child,
Shanks was a cabin boy on Roger’s crew.

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:50.889
And before losing his arm, he could duel evenly
with the strongest swordsman in the world.

00:04:50.889 --> 00:04:55.340
He even stopped the war at Marineford without
even fighting.

00:04:55.340 --> 00:05:01.970
And in the most insane conqueror’s haki
flex in the story, he made an admiral run

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:04.810
away crying from miles away.

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:10.009
But it gets even more insane thanks to the
information in the booklet released with Film

00:05:10.009 --> 00:05:11.009
Red.

00:05:11.009 --> 00:05:15.720
In it we learn that Shanks can coat his sword
in a fiery aura similar to Luffy’s Red Hawk

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:16.720
attack.

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:21.030
Also, Shanks’ nickname in battle is “*the
killer of Observation Haki”* meaning that

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:27.680
he can even stop other strong characters like
Luffy from using their future sight ability.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.020
Mind-blowing.

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:33.919
Truly, Shanks is the definition of a badass
character.

00:05:33.919 --> 00:05:38.690
And he is going to show Luffy that there is
still much to learn about haki.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:43.590
But despite all this new information, there
is still so much about his powers and goals.

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:49.130
Certainly he didn’t have a devil fruit at
the start of the series, but it is possible

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:52.150
he ate one between chapter 1 and becoming
a Yonko.

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:56.600
Besides his fighting skill, he has the clout
to drink booze with Whitebeard, the influence

00:05:56.600 --> 00:06:02.660
to stop Kaido from coming to Marineford, and
the swagger to walk into Mary Geoise to chat

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:04.039
with the Gorosei.

00:06:04.039 --> 00:06:11.110
Also, it is possible that he could be a world
noble or even something more crazy like Rocks

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:12.110
D. Xebex’s son.

00:06:12.110 --> 00:06:16.110
Whatever the truth is, we should find out
soon as he is finally going to take an active

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:18.270
role in the search for the One Piece.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:23.669
And similar to Shanks, another pirate searching
for that legendary treasure is Blackbeard.

00:06:23.669 --> 00:06:29.710
This man is also a Yonko, one of the most
dangerous pirates in the seas, and is Luffy’s

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:32.330
main rival to become pirate king.

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:36.000
The most mysterious thing about him are his
devil fruit powers.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.020
That’s right, I said POWERS.

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:43.450
By some unexplained process, Blackbeard can
use both the Darkness fruit, a power that

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:48.900
is a whole mystery by itself, and the Tremor
fruit, which is said to have the ability to

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:51.400
destroy the entire world.

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:56.750
So what DO WE KNOW about this hidden ability
that allows Blackbeard to have multiple devil

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.490
fruits?

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:02.560
Some theories I’ve covered in other videos
range from his original devil fruit being

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:07.990
the three headed dog Cerberus or a mythical
Octopus, him having a god-like fruit just

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:12.780
like Luffy, or even Blackbeard being triplets
that are stuck in one body.

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:17.470
Each of these theories could explain how he
was able to eat a second devil fruit, and

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:22.090
many wonder if he will eat a third one before
his final fight with Luffy.

00:07:22.090 --> 00:07:25.949
Plus, we still don’t know if Blackbeard
has conqueror’s haki.

00:07:25.949 --> 00:07:30.710
Though one thing we do know is that he has
horrible taste in pies and drinks, at least

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:31.710
according to Luffy

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:35.699
But perhaps Blackbeard’s most important
secret is his connections to the legendary

00:07:35.699 --> 00:07:37.440
pirate Rocks D. Xebec.

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:44.670
Blackbeard could be Rocks’ son, his clone,
or even somehow have Rocks living inside of

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:46.300
him.

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:47.659
Hold on, what?

00:07:47.659 --> 00:07:52.919
One of the strongest pirates ever… living
inside of another pirate.

00:07:52.919 --> 00:07:53.919
That’s right.

00:07:53.919 --> 00:07:55.740
In One Piece, anything is possible.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:08:00.460
Rocks D. Xebec is surrounded with so much
mystery that we are dying to find out what

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:05.350
happened to him and more importantly, how
he was so powerful.

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:10.250
What we DO know is that Rocks was an infamous
pirate 40 years ago and that his goal was

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:12.509
to become King of the World.

00:08:12.509 --> 00:08:17.650
To do that, he ruled over the most insane
pirate crew ever and was only stopped when

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:20.850
Garp and Roger teamed up during the incident
on God Valley.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:25.370
However, the island where this famous battle
occurred was erased from history and we’ve

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:28.560
never had confirmation of Rocks’ death or
his powers.

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:33.270
But if it took the marines, Garp, and Roger
to defeat Rocks, then he must have been a

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:34.990
monstrous fighter.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:39.390
Many theories point to him being the former
user of Blackbeard’s Darkness fruit or another

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:43.310
overpowered devil fruit such as the lightning
fruit.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:47.589
Whatever it was, if his goal was to conquer
the world, then he surely would have possessed

00:08:47.589 --> 00:08:53.510
one of the strongest fruits in the story and
incredibly strong will and haki.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:57.269
Another participant in the famous God Valley
battle was the Dark King Rayleigh.

00:08:57.269 --> 00:09:02.160
Rayleigh was Roger’s former Vice-Captain,
and is said to be nearly as strong as the

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:03.980
former pirate king himself.

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:07.310
He is one of the most powerful swordsmen in
the series.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:12.950
He can easily go head to head with a marine
admiral and he is a master of all forms of

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:13.950
haki.

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:16.950
We also know Rayleigh doesn’t have a devil
fruit as he has been shown swimming multiple

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:20.340
times, which makes his powers even more impressive.

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:23.089
So you might be wondering why he is in this
video.

00:09:23.089 --> 00:09:28.560
Well, he is one of the few living people who
have been to Laugh Tale, and it makes me wonder

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:33.649
if he is hiding some unknown power that we
have yet to see in the series.

00:09:33.649 --> 00:09:38.230
And you can’t talk about Rayleigh without
discussing Roger.

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:42.170
The former pirate king and the man who kicked
off the great pirate age.

00:09:42.170 --> 00:09:47.180
Roger is undoubtedly one of the strongest
One Piece characters ever.

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:53.130
We do know that was a master swordsman, who
wielded one of only twelve existing Supreme

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:54.130
Grade Blades.

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:59.660
He was not a devil fruit user, but there have
been many strange occurrences when we see

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:00.660
him in battle.

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:05.200
For example, in this battle against Shiki,
a sudden storm saves the Roger pirates from

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:06.200
certain death.

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.200
Sound familiar?

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:09.970
[show luffy logue town storm] And just like
Luffy, Roger is one of the very few characters

00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:14.670
to have the Voice of All Things.

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:21.380
Roger could also have haki abilities a level
above anything we have seen in the story,

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:22.430
similar to Shanks.

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:27.730
Also, there’s this giant egg on Roger’s
ship that has never been explained so far

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:28.970
in the story.

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:31.270
Seriously, what is this thing?

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:32.270
An ancient weapon?

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:34.120
A mythical creature?

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:39.990
We don’t know, but whatever it is, it is
just one more mystery surrounding the full

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:45.520
powers of the former pirate king and what
exactly he found so funny at Laugh Tale.

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:49.330
And while we don’t know what Roger found
there, we can guess that it was something

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:52.690
Imu wants erased from history.

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:58.779
This secret ruler of the world has appeared
in just 18 panels IN THE ENTIRE STORY and

00:10:58.779 --> 00:11:01.089
has never said a word!

00:11:01.089 --> 00:11:04.190
We don’t even know if they are a man or
a woman.

00:11:04.190 --> 00:11:08.430
But everytime they do appear we get world
changing events.

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:12.160
We know that the Gorosei take orders from
Imu.

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:16.839
They sit on the Empty Throne, which we were
told NO ONE is allowed to do.

00:11:16.839 --> 00:11:21.960
And we are led to believe that they can order
the destruction of entire islands [show destruction

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:22.960
of Lulusia].

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:27.209
But despite Imu’s limited panels, they are
clearly set up as one of the main antagonists

00:11:27.209 --> 00:11:31.459
the straw hats will face before the end of
the story.

00:11:31.459 --> 00:11:35.730
And so we have to ask what their powers may
be?

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:37.300
Do they control an ancient weapon?

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:40.240
Do they have a super powered devil fruit?

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:43.570
Can their observation haki span the entire
world?

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:46.579
What is the deal with this giant straw hat?

00:11:46.579 --> 00:11:51.230
And most importantly, just how long has Imu
been alive?

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:57.480
It is very possible that Imu has lived since
the Void Century, secretly pulling the strings

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:00.990
of the world to keep themselves alive and
in power.

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:06.570
I know I can’t wait to find out the answers
to all of Imu’s mysteries.

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:12.269
And while Imu is likely one of the final villains,
the Gorosei seem to be the next World Government

00:12:12.269 --> 00:12:15.399
opponents the straw hats will face.

00:12:15.399 --> 00:12:18.630
These Five Elder Stars rule the world government
for Imu.

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:24.250
They have complete control over the marines,
Cipher Pol, and technology developed by the

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:26.529
genius scientist, Dr. Vegapunk.

00:12:26.529 --> 00:12:31.630
And they are willing to have entire islands
destroyed to protect their deepest secrets,

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:34.959
though at least some of them show remorse
over doing so.

00:12:34.959 --> 00:12:39.300
While we don’t know if they have been alive
for as long as Imu, they are certainly not

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:41.300
your average world noble.

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:45.550
Despite never seeing them fight, it is likely
that each of these men are unafraid of battle.

00:12:45.550 --> 00:12:49.740
Many show scars and one carries what is likely
a cursed sword.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:55.000
As a group they were not concerned about being
in the presence of Shanks without any guards

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:56.000
to protect them.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.709
Plus they felt perfectly safe bossing around
Akainu.

00:12:59.709 --> 00:13:04.680
*blows air* No one in their right mind does
that if they can’t defend themselves.

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:10.399
In fact, Saint Saturn here is heading into
a battle ground on Egghead Island.

00:13:10.399 --> 00:13:14.000
And Kizaru shows him an uncommon amount of
respect.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:19.329
Truly we don’t know what the Gorosei are
capable of, but get ready because those answers

00:13:19.329 --> 00:13:21.029
are likely coming soon.

00:13:21.029 --> 00:13:26.310
Now, one character that the Gorosei definitely
want eliminated is the smartest man in the

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:27.930
world, Dr. Vegapunk.

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:31.190
In the current arc, we learn that Vegapunk
has studied the Void Century.

00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:38.120
This is a blank 100 year gap in history from
800 years ago, and since Vegapunk has studied

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:44.260
it, that means he likely knows information
about the ancient kingdom and its incredible

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:45.260
technology.

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:48.769
But it also means the government is trying
to kill him.

00:13:48.769 --> 00:13:54.540
And while his Brain fruit powers don’t have
much use in battle, Vegapunk’s inventions

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:58.450
certainly make him one of the most dangerous
character’s in the world.

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:04.690
For example, just two of these Seraphim he
created are capable of making even a Yonko

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:05.690
hesitate.

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:09.060
And Vegapunk has even successfully recreated
actual devil fruits.

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:11.480
Such an insane ability.

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:16.420
Imagine more lightning users, more dragons,
or even more Caribou’s… wait no.

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:17.930
Please no more Caribou’s.

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:22.310
Plus, it’s likely we haven’t seen everything
Vegapunk is capable of.

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:27.160
If he really was close to uncovering the secrets
of the Ancient Kingdom’s technology, then

00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:29.910
the world is definitely about to change.

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:35.850
And one character that Vegapunk likely learned
a lot about is the mysterious Joy Boy.

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:42.850
In chapter 628, we learn that Joy Boy was
a person from the void century who was part

00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:44.839
of the legendary ancient kingdom.

00:14:44.839 --> 00:14:50.310
While it is likely that Joy Boy was once an
actual person, it seems the phrase has become

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:52.360
more of a title.

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:57.550
We know this because when Luff y awakened
the Sun God Nika fruit, Zunesha, this giant

00:14:57.550 --> 00:15:02.910
walking elephant with an island on their back,
announced that Joy Boy had returned.

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:07.899
And while Luffy was bouncing around with his
insane new powers, we don’t know exactly

00:15:07.899 --> 00:15:14.700
how this made him Joy Boy or how he connects
to the person from the Void Century.

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:19.920
Not much is known about the actual powers
of the past Joy Boy, but we can assume that

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:25.120
this person also possessed the Nika fruit,
and it was their role to bring freedom and

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:26.380
joy to the world.

00:15:26.380 --> 00:15:30.360
The Joy Boy from the past probably also had
access to incredible technology.

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:34.860
In recent chapters, we learn that the Void
Century was a time of great technological

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:38.920
advancements and that the world today is still
trying to relearn all the secrets that were

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:39.920
lost.

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:42.069
Also, Joy Boy could likely use the Ancient
Weapons.

00:15:42.069 --> 00:15:46.990
One of them could have been used to command
Zunesha and if he really had this power, then

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:51.250
we have to wonder how he and the ancient kingdom
ever lost to the world government 800 years

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:52.250
ago.

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:56.470
But Eiichiro Oda, the author of one piece,
has left us clues that we can use to learn

00:15:56.470 --> 00:16:01.420
more about this mysterious figure, the battle
during the void century, and how the knowledge

00:16:01.420 --> 00:16:05.440
Joy Boy left behind will change the one piece
world forever.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:09.530
Everything that we know I explain in this
video right here [Everything we know about

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:10.530
Joy Boy video].

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:10.619
Shanks for watching.

